"╭ ╭ Keys (vim) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Room list (continued)                          │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         k           Previous room                     │ │"
"│▌│  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     g           First room                        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-←       Go to the room list               G           Last room                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               l           Messages                          │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                i           Composer                          │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer                /           Find in this room                 │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                        Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          Del         Delete (own messages)             │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 m           Menu for the message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)       End         Jump to newest                    │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                       ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          j           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  F3          Next theme                        k           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-P      Command palette                   g           Jump to oldest                    │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-N      New chat or room…                 G           Jump to newest                    │─╮"
"│ │  F4          Room info and members             h           Room list                         │ │"
"╰─│  Menu        Menu for what has the focus       l           Composer                          │─╯"
" ●╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ↑↓ scroll · Esc to close ╯k "
